<title>SPAIN: Rato sees Spain '97 private consumption at 2.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Rato sees Spain '97 private consumption at 2.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Spanish government's 1997 budget draft foresees a rise in private consumption of 0.6 percent to 2.7 percent, Economy Minister Rodrigo Rato said on Friday.</p>
</text>
